    &lt;h1 style="margin-top: 2rem;"&gt;Welcome to my page&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;h2 class="text-red" style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;Quantitative Finance&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p style="max-width: 800px; margin: 2rem auto; font-size: 1.25rem; color: #f3f4f6; opacity: 0.8;"&gt;
        The primary quantitative architecture and research repository for Gorazd Atanasovski. All deployments prioritize rigorous signal synthesis, stochastic framework derivation, and algorithmic market execution over standard heuristic approximations.
    &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="grid-2"&gt;
    &lt;div class="card-quant"&gt;
        &lt;h3&gt;Mathematical Theories&lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;p style="color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 2rem;"&gt;Rigorous formalization of market microstructure dynamics, continuous-time pricing frameworks, and stochastic differential equations. Heuristic approximations are systematically rejected in favor of exact derivations.&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;a href="research.qmd" class="btn-quant"&gt;Initialize Proofs&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div class="card-quant"&gt;
        &lt;h3&gt;Software & Engineering&lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;p style="color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 2rem;"&gt;Computational execution environments. Featuring the `gorazd` Python library, an institutional-grade Gradient-Optimized Regime-Aware Zero-allocation Dispatcher engineered for zero-latency bare-metal execution.&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;a href="code.qmd" class="btn-quant"&gt;Execute models&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="card-quant" style="margin-top: 4rem;"&gt;
    &lt;h2&gt;Algo Trading Society&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p style="color: #64748b;"&gt;Founder and lead architect. The society operates as an elite computational finance incubator, synthesizing mathematical rigor with high-performance C++ and Python infrastructure to bridge the gap between abstract academic theory and live market synchronization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
